{"id":"behemoth-heart","name":{"en":"Behemoth Heart","ja":"ベヒモスの心臓"},"desc":{"en":"A heart with such vitality that it still beats outside the body. Its surface is hard as a rock and it beats with a grave, crackling sound.","ja":"未だに動き続けている、強い生命力を備えた 心臓。表面は石のように硬く、それがバキバ キ音をたてながら、絶えることなく脈動して いる。鉱石素材としても扱うことができる。"},"level":8,"monsters":[{"id":"wasteland-beast","name":{"en":"Wasteland Beast","ja":"荒野の魔獣"}},{"id":"behemoth","name":{"en":"Behemoth","ja":"ビヒモス"}}],"traits":{"id":"wake-up","name":{"en":"Wake Up","ja":"気付け効果"}},"categories":[{"id":"elixir","name":{"en":"(Elixir)","ja":"（エリキシル）"},"icon":"totori-category-elixir"},{"id":"healing","name":{"en":"(Healing)","ja":"（薬品）"},"icon":"totori-category-healing"},{"id":"meat","name":{"en":"(Meat)","ja":"（食材・肉）"},"icon":"totori-category-meat"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":74}